---
{# Template: bug-hunt/bug-hunt-report.j2 #}
{# Functional Role: KnowAct — Produce a structured JSON bug report from charter, oracle, and taxonomy results #}
{# Implementation: Jinja2 prompt #}
{# Produces: report #}
{# Phase 5 — REPORT (structured JSON bug report) #}
{# hKask v0.31.0 — Bug Hunting Expedition #}
{#
  v0.31.0 refinement: the report now emits lessons_learned and
  pattern_signatures. These are consumed by the next expedition's charter
  (via the manifest's loop step routing them as prior_expedition) to close
